agem e redação final de proposta sobre perícia facial\r\n        </h1>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"solidline\"></div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"col-lg-8 col-lg-offset-2 marginbot20\">\r\n                <center>\r\n                    <img src=\"/upload/News/2026/10/2026_10_14_07_29_18_6f6b86be-472a-4ab7-bc75-aab54e34f4cb.jpg\" alt=\"Imagem: Sess&#xE3;o ordin&#xE1;ria da Assembleia Legislativa come&#xE7;a &#xE0;s 9h aberta a participa&#xE7;&#xE3;o da sociedade \" class=\"img-responsive\" />\r\n                    <div class=\"img_subtitle\">Sess&#xE3;o ordin&#xE1;ria da Assembleia Legislativa come&#xE7;a &#xE0;s 9h aberta a participa&#xE7;&#xE3;o da sociedade </div>\r\n                </center>\r\n            </div>\r\n        <div class=\"col-lg-10 col-lg-offset-1\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-lg-12 text-left\">\r\n                <strong>15/10/2026 - 07:00</strong>\r\n                <strong>Por:</strong> Fl&#xE1;vio Paes &nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n                    <strong>Foto:</strong> \r\nWagner Guimar&#xE3;es\r\n                <br>\r\n                <br>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"col-lg-10 col-lg-offset-1\">\r\n            <div class=\"texto_noticias text-justify\">\r\n                <div class=\"texto_noticias text-justify\">\r\n                    <div id=\"news-content\">\r\n                        <span style=\"padding-bottom:40px\">\r\n                            <i class=\"fa fa-spinner fa-spin\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:24px; color:#007bff;\"></i>\r\n                            Carregando conteúdo...\r\n                        </span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"col-lg-10 col-lg-offset-1\">\r\n            <div class=\"sharethis-inline-share-buttons\"></div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"col-lg-10 col-lg-offset-1 margintop10\">\r\n                <span style=\"font-style:normal; font